// `Identified by A, B`, `1, 2, 3`, and `1..5` enumerate a finite domain; `+x.` creates every instance of an enumerable type.
Fact x Identified by 1..3
Fact y Identified by A, B
Fact z Identified by 4, 5.
+x. +y. +z.
?x(1). ?x(3). ?y(A). ?y(B). ?z(4). ?z(5).
?!(Exists x: x == 4).
?(Count(Foreach x: x) == 3).
